Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?diag(uefi):=20=E6=8E=A2=E9=92=88=E5=8E=8B?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=88=90=E5=9B=9B=E8=A1=8C=EF=BC=8C=E6=AF=8F=E8=A1=8C=E4=B8=8D?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=B6=85=2064=20=E5=AD=97=E8=8A=82?=
